# Public documentation allowlist for release bundles (F-A8-03).
#
# The packaging scripts copy only the entries listed here into bundle/docs/.
# They fail closed if this manifest is missing, if a listed file is missing, or
# if a copied file matches a denied internal-document pattern (security-*,
# *audit*, *review*, release-report*, audit_matrix*, architecture-gap*,
# reuse-matrix*, public-release-hygiene*, *alpha-report*). Unknown files are
# never shipped. This manifest is the public repository's curated set.

